// Citation Weinstein, S. (1988). Secrets for Profiting in Bull and Bear Markets. Dow Jones-Irwin.
// Citation TrendSpider Weinstein Stage Analysis (https://charts.trendspider.com/shared/679813ca6550e0000970233f)
